    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Venom",
    "summary": "During [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), as this model is picked to make an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**, you can Empower it by paying a [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). While it remains Empowered, units aboard it can [disembark](vsdata:core-rule/disembarking) once its advance move is done. Each unit that does is treated as if it made a **[normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)** in that phase, and it cannot declare a charge that turn, but otherwise acts as usual for the rest of it.",
